---
/**
 * Citation — extrait carnet de tournée, fond rose-creme doux,
 * italique large be-vietnam, attribution discrete.
 */
---

<section class="relative bg-doudou-soleil/40 text-doudou-encre py-24 md:py-36 px-6 md:px-10 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-[420px] h-[420px] rounded-full bg-doudou-rose/15 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -left-24 w-[420px] h-[420px] rounded-full bg-doudou-ciel/25 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    <span class="scroll-reveal block font-nunito font-bold text-doudou-rose/30 leading-none select-none" style="font-size: clamp(120px, 18vw, 220px);" aria-hidden="true">
      &ldquo;
    </span>

    <blockquote class="scroll-reveal -mt-16 md:-mt-24 font-be-vietnam italic text-doudou-encre leading-[1.25] tracking-tight" style="font-size: clamp(28px, 4.4vw, 50px);">
      Prendre soin, ce n'est pas un service. C'est un rythme,
      <span class="block mt-3 not-italic font-nunito font-bold text-doudou-bleu">une présence, et beaucoup de patience.</span>
    </blockquote>

    <footer class="scroll-reveal mt-12 inline-flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="block w-12 h-px bg-doudou-rose" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="font-be-vietnam uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-doudou-encre/70 text-[11px]">
        Carnet de tournée — aidante diplômée
      </p>
      <span class="block w-12 h-px bg-doudou-rose" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</section>
